OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,7,Fsaid it accepted that Wali's behaviour
OL,8,Fdid not have a "sexual motive" and
OL,9,Fconcluded he still had a "positive
OL,10,Fcontribution" to make to the
OL,11,Fprofession.
